WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
- So I tell the story of the first time

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.930
I set up a play date for Sasha

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.520
because I just had to find a mother

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:06.900
that I thought I wanted to meet.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.270
- I just love that
you're doing a play date.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:11.520
- We set up a play date.
- I can't imagine that call.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.500
- She is now a good friend of mine

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.277
but at first I just
saw her and I was like,

00:00:15.277 --> 00:00:18.480
"Why don't you have
little Olivia come over?"

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.160
And of course she was like, "Sure."

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.680
And so later, as we became friends,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.330
she told me the story of what it was like

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.760
coming to pick Olivia up after that,

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.233
coming to the White House.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.700
What is on the other
side of being my friend?

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.190
Well, it is a social security check,

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:38.220
it's background check.
- Background check, all that.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:41.010
- It's a clear vet before you
can even come in the gate.

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.570
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:44.850
- Not to mention she wasn't
even coming in the house

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:47.790
but she went and got her
hair done, her nails done,

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.898
washed her car.
- She was like, yeah!

00:00:49.898 --> 00:00:52.896
- She was like, I'm not showing
up messy at the White House,

00:00:52.896 --> 00:00:57.660
so she pulls in and I
decide outside of protocol

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:01.620
that I'm gonna take little
Olivia down to the south lawn.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.290
Well, you do not leave the
residence as a principal

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:07.440
because it sets off all
this outside security.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.900
The counter assault team goes into action.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.070
- Oh my god.

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:14.580
- Black flack jackets
with machine guns, dogs.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.020
They start descending.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:20.550
So here I come, her car is
now surrounded by security.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:23.280
I step out into the south
lawn with little Olivia

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:26.220
and I'm like, "Get out, come on out."

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.110
But she had been explicitly told

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:31.050
under no circumstances, ma'am,

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:33.630
are you to get out of your car.

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:34.630
- This woman is about to pee her pants.

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:36.720
- So I'm calling her, I'm like, "Get out."

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:38.713
And she's like, (groans)

00:01:38.713 --> 00:01:41.130
(both laughing)

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:46.130
So she's slowly gets out carefully
and we have a great chat.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.630
She played it all off, I
didn't know any of this,

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:50.277
so I'm retelling her story in the book.

00:01:50.277 --> 00:01:51.750
- Oh, this is a nice woman.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.120
- And she is now one of my best friends.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.670
Olivia's like a daughter to me.

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:59.040
Lo and behold, the new daisy popped up

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:00.900
and it is a beautiful thing.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.290
And if I hadn't taken
the risk to extend myself

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:09.290
and to reach out to a
stranger, and make a friend,

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.740
she wouldn't be in my life.

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:15.540
And so if I can make new
friends, anybody can, all right?

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.750
- 'Cause its painful, right?
(audience clapping)

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:20.207
(laughing) Oh my God!

